@startuml
title Current backend | Authorized Jitsi room access | FR-011
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "Booking party / API caller" as U
participant Gateway as G
participant "RequestRoomAccessUseCase" as C
database "live_class schema" as D
participant "JitsiRoomTokenIssuer" as I
participant "Self-hosted Jitsi" as J
U -> G: POST /api/classes/bookings/:bookingId/room-access
G -> C: Trusted identity; validated request
C -> D: Read booking + class
C -> C: Check party, confirmed state and access window
alt access denied
 C --> U: Forbidden / invalid access
else authorized
 C -> I: Issue room-scoped short-lived HS256 JWT locally
 alt issuer fails
  C -> D: Record room-access incident
  C --> U: 503 + trace
 else token issued
  I --> C: room, token, expiresAt, url
  C --> U: Room access response
  U -> J: Join with room URL + JWT (HTTPS/WebRTC)
 end
end
note over I,J: Token signing is local.\nNo REST call to create a Jitsi room is implied.
@enduml
